  o Minor features (denial of service mitigation):
    - Directory caches can now refuse any BEGIN_DIR after the first one on a
      circuit from an authenticated relay. This is controlled by the new
      DoSBeginDirLimitEnabled consensus parameter, disabled by default.
      Refusals are reported in the heartbeat and in the
      relay_dos_total{type="begindir_rejected"} metric. Closes ticket 41411.
